          ],
          "params": [],
          "returnType": "void",
          "description": "Marks the effect unwired and drops a setup still waiting for the AudioContext, so a destroyed effect is never wired again and never builds its nodes late. An effect not yet ready rejects ready with an AbortError; a setup still in flight can no longer resolve it."
        },
